---
const pains = [
  {
    title: 'Your cloud bill keeps creeping up.',
    detail:
      'Nobody’s reviewing what you’re actually using. Most SMBs overpay 30–40% on AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Your backups exist — but have they ever been tested?',
    detail:
      '“We have backups” and “we can recover from ransomware” are not the same sentence.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Your security is “we use strong passwords.”',
    detail:
      '60% of small businesses close within 6 months of a major breach. Hope is not a strategy.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Your apps are duct-taped together.',
    detail:
      'Workarounds on workarounds. Every new hire spends a week learning your tribal-knowledge tech stack.',
  },
  {
    title: 'You have no tech roadmap.',
    detail:
      'Every decision is reactive. Every vendor pitch sounds good because you have no framework to evaluate it.',
  },
];
---
<section class="border-b border-border">
  <div class="container-px max-w-7xl mx-auto py-24 md:py-32 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <p class="label">// The reality</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">
        Most small businesses are <span class="italic text-lime">one outage</span>, one breach, or one bad cloud bill away from a really bad week.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-fg/70 text-lg leading-relaxed pt-2 border-t border-border mt-4">
        You don’t need a $200K CTO. You need a partner who’s already solved
        this for 15 years.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
      {pains.map((p) => (
        <li class="flex gap-5">
          <span class="shrink-0 mt-1 text-lime/80" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15" />
              <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-fg text-lg leading-snug font-medium">{p.title}</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed mt-1">{p.detail}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
